# Cloud agent

Run `mise trust && mise install` once at the start of a cloud machine.

Rust tests exclude `chair-desktop`. A missing WebKit library is an environment gap, not a product bug.

Do not read or write `.env`. Copy from `.env.example` only if a command needs the variable names. Do not download footage or model weights.

Claim the issue with the desk skill before editing. Ask the user before merging, the same way a local agent does.
